{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"centers\": [\n    {\n      \"options\": [\n        \"幸福与失去幸福的担忧始终并存。\",\n        \"对幸福的珍惜与失去幸福的担忧始终相伴。\",\n        \"眼前的幸福与无法留住幸福的忧伤始终并存。\"\n      ],\n      \"center\": \"眼前的幸福与无法留住幸福的忧伤始终并存。\",\n      \"distinct_because\": \"核心是幸福尚在时，无法长久保有幸福所带来的忧伤；不是深情的表达受到克制。\",\n      \"basis\": \"A：13份文章的最大共识，强调幸福真实存在时已有隐痛。B：A1的解释力89%，说服力8.5，是上一轮支持最强的方向。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"options\": [\n        \"深情与自我克制始终互相牵制。\",\n        \"对亲密的投入与自我克制始终相互牵制。\",\n        \"深情的表达与维持分寸始终彼此牵制。\"\n      ],\n      \"center\": \"对亲密的投入与自我克制始终相互牵制。\",\n      \"distinct_because\": \"核心是深情投入与自我控制都需要维持，却彼此妨碍；矛盾来自情感的强度和表达方式，而不是幸福无法长久。\",\n      \"basis\": \"A：6份文章强调深情与克制的矛盾。B：A2的解释力86%，说服力8.5。C：直接继承并精简亲密投入与控制相互牵制的历史候选。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c20e3819-6d3b-47c1-be91-40163fd1d101", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261021T180132832956Z", "elapsed_seconds": 212.687, "completed_utc": "2026-10-21T18:05:05.531261+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e01f29cc9db72929c05c3239de6f69ebd2a4618077bb682234d9b42641b1453f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sh